# Project map (Godot 4.x)

- **Combat orchestrator:** `combat/CombatManager.gd` — Node with `combatants`, `event_queue`, signals. Keeps registration, `start()` (seeds **`formation_doctrine`** via **`CombatConstants.encounter_formation_doctrine_string`** on **`encounter`**, then **`CombatConstants.formation_doctrine_string_from_dict`** on each preset dict — **`FORMATION_PRESET_KEY_DOCTRINE`** + **`FORMATION_PRESET_KEY_DOCTRINE_ALT`**, per side; seeds **`depth_polearm_ai_doctrine_mults_by_fid`** via **`CombatConstants.depth_polearm_ai_doctrine_mults_for_encounter_and_preset`**; reads use **`get_depth_polearm_ai_doctrine_mult`**), and thin `func` forwards. Loaded via `core/ResourcePaths.gd` → `COMBAT_MANAGER`. Public **`get_health_entity(node)`** for Character→CoreEntity resolution; subsystems use **`CombatantEntityAccess.get_entity_from_manager`** / **`get_health_entity_from_node`**. **`CombatFileKeyedDict`** for int/string file keys in formation breach/wedge dicts.
- **Combat subsystems (preload from manager or call static):** `CombatProcessTick`, `CombatEventScheduler` (**`reschedule_back_rank_turns`** + rank/file snapshots vs **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), `CombatEventDispatch`, `CombatResolveAction`, `CombatEngagementResolver`, `CombatFormationFlow` (intrusion slots + **`intrusion_wedge_by_file`** + vacancy/death plugs + **`on_combatant_died`** host **`slot_obstacles`** / `notify` vs **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`** + **`reconcile_vacancy_plugs_*`** from `CombatManager.notify_formation_changed` / `get_available_actions`), `CombatIntrusionWedge` (wedge upsert/clear; lane-stress helper), `CombatFormationSetup`, `CombatFormationEngagement` (line cohesion + posture; wedge/breach; LINE↔OPEN hysteresis; calls **`CombatMoraleCohesion`** for `morale_cohesion_factor`), `CombatIntrusionGeometry` (crash neighbor hold on **host** line via **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), `CombatDistanceBands` (**`depth_polearm_lane_open_by_combatant_id`**; regression names → **`docs/REGRESSION_HARNESS_MAP_TIER19.md`** + plan Tier 1.9 harness map), `ZoneOfControl` (**`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**, **`formation_dict_for_zone_geometry`** — intruder host fid + shared **`formations[fid]`** read for **`assign_combatant_zones`**, **`count_alive_in_zone`** (ZoC fill), ZoC **engagement parry**, **pair distance**, **AI targeting / crash** formation lookups), `TacticalCombat` (lane stress: max(breach_local, wedge)), `BreachResolver`, `FormationBreachRules`, `CombatCombatantsSnapshot` (UI rows), `CombatMedicalCoordination` (retry / parts under treatment), `AttackResolver`, `AvailableActionsBuilder` (`effective_pair_eff_dist`: host geometry + `lane_offset` + wedge pull; **`ordered_melee_opponents`** via **`CombatTargetScoring`**), **`CombatTargetScoring`** (hostile listed weights: doctrine pinch/hold, engagement mode, posture+cohesion, opponent formation, breached-file column (**`opponent_breach_file_targeting_mult`**), stance; intruder-aware via **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), **`CombatDoctrine`** (per-formation doctrine string; automatic pinch pilot), **`CombatAIActionPicker`** (weighted `pick`; crash viability × posture × line cohesion; depth spear stab/cut × doctrine; prunes commitments once per pick), `MedicalPhaseController`, etc. under `combat/`. **`FEATURE_LINE_CRASH_INTRUSION`** in `CombatConstants.gd` (default **false**) gates **new** line-crash intrusions; see `IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` Development gate. **Doc index:** `docs/README.md`. **Implementation plan / milestone status:** `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` only — **do not** duplicate milestone **Status** text in rules (see that file’s **Milestone summary** under Tier 1). **Tier 1 spec** §4–§6: `docs/ENGAGEMENT_LINE_COHESION_INTRUSION_PLAN.md`.
- **Weapons (abstract impact):** `weapon/WeaponConstants.gd`, `weapon/WeaponDamageHelper.gd`, `weapon/ImpactVelocityModel.gd`, `weapon/WeaponSwingPhysics.gd` — **Tier 3.0** thrust vs swing **`kinematic_delivery`** (plan: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` Tier 3 + dependency chain item 12).
